nds from 0 5cm below the overlying skin ellipse to abut the deep resection margin at its closest extent  There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm tan white fibrous area adjacent to the biopsy cavity at one edge  that extends to abut the closest deep margin  The remaining breast parenchyma is tan yellow and grossly unremarkable  B SECTION CODE  A C  biopsy cavity  closest deep margin D  fibrous area adjacent to biopsy cavity  closest deep E F  biopsy cavity G H  representative section of biopsy cavity overlying skin I J  en face sections of edges of lumpectomy  grossly unremarkable breast  Received  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axillary nodes  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm segment of fat containing multiple tan lymph nodes  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 3 0cm in diameter  The largest node has a tan pink nodule cut surface  Nodes are submitted in cassettes K through Q  Resident  Simon Bergman  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Leslie Wayne Ottinger  M D  Simon Bergman  M D  PART A  AXILLARY NODES  LEFT  PART B  BREAST RE EXCISION  LEFT  , Unchecked.
